duality! Possible values are \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]MVInverseI\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] (default), \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]MVReverseI\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] ,\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]ReverseMVI\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]and \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]MVI\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote], which implements \
definitions  ",
